                        <span class="dh-more-icon"><i class="ph ph-github-logo"></i></span>
                        <span class="dh-more-text"><strong>GitHub Repo</strong><small>Star &amp; fork the project</small></span>
                      </a></li>
                      <li><a class="dh-more-item" href="/docs/">
                        <span class="dh-more-icon"><i class="ph ph-book-open-text"></i></span>
                        <span class="dh-more-text"><strong>Documentation</strong><small>Guides &amp; references</small></span>
                      </a></li>
                      <li><a class="dh-more-item" href="https://github.com/imswarnil/Namaste-Salesforce/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <span class="dh-more-icon"><i class="ph ph-bug"></i></span>
                        <span class="dh-more-text"><strong>Report a Bug</strong><small>Open a GitHub issue</small></span>
                      </a></li>
